RUNSPEC
TITLE
   flow_ph_co2store: a producer at the surface (reference depth 0, 1500 m wellbore) produces brine and CO2 from the aquifer; the CO2 expands and comes out of solution in the well
DIMENS
   40 1 1 /
EQLDIMS
/
TABDIMS
/
WELLDIMS
 2 1 1 2 /
ENTHALPY
CO2STORE
OIL
GAS
WATER
METRIC
START
   1 'JAN' 2020 /
UNIFOUT
GRID
INIT
DX
   40*5 /
DY
   40*10 /
DZ
   40*10 /
TOPS
   40*1495 /
PORO
   40*0.2 /
PERMX
   40*1000 /
PERMY
   40*1000 /
PERMZ
   40*1000 /
HEATCR
   40*2000 /
HEATCRT
   40*0 /
THCONR
   40*150 /
PROPS
-- Sw krw pcow
SWFN
 0.2 0.0 0
 0.6 0.25 0
 1.0 1.0 0 /
-- Sg krg pcgo
SGFN
 0.0 0.0 0
 0.4 0.2 0
 0.8 0.7 0 /
-- So krow krog (the oil phase is liquid CO2)
SOF3
 0.0 0.0 0.0
 0.4 0.1 0.1
 0.8 0.8 0.8 /
ROCK
 200 1.0e-3 /
SOLUTION
PRESSURE
 40*200 /
TEMPI
 40*67 /
SWAT
 40*0.85 /
SUMMARY
BPR
 1 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
 40 1 1 /
/
BTEMP
 1 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
 40 1 1 /
/
BSGAS
 1 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
/
BSWAT
 1 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
/
SCHEDULE
RPTRST
  'BASIC=2' 'ALLPROPS' /
-- Both wells have their reference depth at the surface (0 m). The producer is controlled by the pressure at the
-- surface (75 bar): the fluid of the aquifer (brine with free CO2, 200 bar and 67 C) rises through 1500 m, the pressure falls and
-- CO2 comes out of solution. The injector puts 40 m3/day of brine of 30 C (the volume at the surface pressure) into the other end.
WELSPECS
 'INJ' 'G' 1  1 0 'WATER' /
 'PRO' 'G' 40 1 0 'WATER' /
/
COMPDAT
 'INJ' 1  1 1 1 'OPEN' 1* 1* 0.2 /
 'PRO' 40 1 1 1 'OPEN' 1* 1* 0.2 /
/
WCONINJE
 'INJ' 'WATER' 'OPEN' 'RESV' 1* 40 /
/
WINJTEMP
 'INJ' 1* 30 /
/
WCONPROD
  'PRO' 'OPEN' 'BHP' 5* 75 /
/
TSTEP
  10*1 /
END
